request.description:
Returns the parameter schema for a profile document, listing all configurable parameters with their current values, constraints, and guidance. Optionally filter by control family.

Response format:
```json
{
  "parameters": [
    {
      "id": "ac-1_prm_1",
      "control_id": "ac-1",
      "label": "organization-defined frequency",
      "value": "annually",
      "guidelines": "FedRAMP requires at least annually"
    }
  ]
}
```

