request.description:
Returns all control mappings that define relationships between controls across different frameworks and catalogs.

Response format:
```json
{
  "control_mappings": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "source_control_id": "ac-1",
      "target_control_id": "A.5.1",
      "source_framework": "NIST SP 800-53 Rev 5",
      "target_framework": "ISO 27001:2022",
      "relationship": "equivalent"
    }
  ]
}
```

body.raw:
{
  "control_mapping": {
    "source_catalog_id": 1,
    "target_catalog_id": 2,
    "source_control_identifier": "ac-1",
    "target_control_identifier": "A.5.1",
    "relationship": "equivalent",
    "notes": "Both controls address access control policy and procedures"
  }
}

{
  "control_mapping": {
    "relationship": "partial",
    "notes": "Updated: AC-1 partially maps to A.5.1 — scope differs in organizational applicability"
  }
}

