request.description:
Uploads a document file for asynchronous parsing into an SSP document with controls and control fields. The file is processed by a background Sidekiq job. Returns a conversion job ID for status polling.

Response: 202 Accepted with conversion job details:
```json
{
  "conversion_job": {
    "id": 1,
    "status": "pending"
  }
}
```

